+44%；完成 Playrion 交易"},{"title":"Old Dominion Freight Line Inc Stock (ODFL) Moved Down by 7.56% on Oct 28: What Signal Does It Send?","src":"TradingKey","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOZGxKWGVaaC1keGJVRy1GQWlsSzhHTDJXSVo2SmRBRjN1QXVwQ05hNTI1OHVScVh4MWZGUjF4Ym9jR2JsVTV2WVlIODdzc0N4MnkxbEwyUlFFYW5pRFV5XzJ5VTROY0kyYXZCZmdlNmVNYW1QUGxPRWI4UEJZOTg3ODVSYzBEbTJEdHU0?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":""}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":4}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-24","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/878927/000119312526067161/odfl-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Unless the context requires otherwise, references in this report to \"Old Dominion,\" the \"Company,\" \"we,\" \"us\" and \"our\" refer to Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc.","zh":""},{"en":"We are one of the largest North American less-than-truckload (\"LTL\") motor carriers. We provide regional, inter-regional and national LTL services through a single integrated, union-free organization. Our service offerings, which include expedited transportation, are provided through an expansive network of service centers located throughout the continental United States. Through strategic alliances, we also provide LTL services throughout North America. In addition to our core LTL services, we offer a range of value-added services including container drayage, truckload brokerage and supply chain consulting. More than 98% of our revenue has historically been derived from transporting LTL shipments for our customers, whose demand for our services is generally tied to industrial production and the overall health of the U.S. domestic economy.","zh":"我們是北美最大的零擔（「LTL」）汽車承運商之一。我們透過一個單一的、無工會的綜合組織提供區域、區域間和國家零擔服務。我們的服務（包括加急運輸）是透過遍布美國大陸的廣泛服務中心網路提供的。透過策略聯盟，我們也在整個北美地區提供零擔服務。除了我們的核心零擔服務外，我們還提供一系列加值服務，包括貨櫃拖運、整車經紀和供應鏈諮詢。歷史上，我們超過 98% 的收入來自為客戶運輸零擔貨物，他們對我們服務的需求通常與工業生產和美國國內經濟的整體健康狀況有關。"},{"en":"We have increased our revenue and customer base over the past ten years primarily through organic market share growth. Our infrastructure allows us to provide service through each of our regions covering the continental United States. In addition to numerous service center renovations, expansions, and existing service center relocations, we opened a net 16 and 35 service centers over the past five and ten years, respectively, for a total of 260 service centers at December 31, 2025. We believe these actions produced increased capacity within our service center network and provide us with opportunities for future growth.","zh":"在過去十年中，我們主要透過有機市場份額成長來增加收入和客戶群。我們的基礎設施使我們能夠在覆蓋美國大陸的每個地區提供服務。除了大量的服務中心翻新、擴建和現有服務中心搬遷之外，我們在過去五年和十年中分別淨開設了 16 個和 35 個服務中心，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，服務中心總數達到 260 個。我們相信這些行動增加了我們服務中心網路的容量，並為我們提供了未來成長的機會。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Revenue is generated primarily from customers throughout the United States and North America. In 2025, our largest customer accounted for approximately 4% of our revenue and our largest 5, 10 and 20 customers accounted for approximately 11%, 16% and 23% of our revenue, respectively. For the last three fiscal years, more than 95% of our revenue was derived from services performed in the United States and less than 5% of our revenue was generated from services performed internationally. We believe the diversity of our customer base helps protect our business from adverse developments in a single geographic region and from the reduction or loss of business from a single customer.","zh":"收入主要來自美國和北美的客戶。 2025年，我們最大的客戶約占我們收入的4%，我們最大的5、10和20個客戶分別約占我們收入的11%、16%和23%。在過去的三個財年中，我們超過 95% 的收入來自在美國提供的服務，不到 5% 的收入來自在國際上提供的服務。我們相信，客戶群的多樣性有助於保護我們的業務免受單一地理區域不利發展以及單一客戶業務減少或損失的影響。"},{"en":"We utilize an integrated freight-costing system to determine the price level at which a particular freight shipment will be profitable. We can modify elements of this freight-costing model to simulate the actual conditions under which the freight will be moved. Many of our customers engage our services through the terms and provisions of our tariffs and through negotiated service contracts. We also compete for business by participating in bid solicitations. Customers generally solicit bids for relatively large numbers of shipments for a period of one to two years and typically choose to enter into contractual arrangements with a limited number of motor carriers based upon price and service.","zh":"我們利用綜合貨運成本會計系統來確定特定貨運的獲利價格水準。我們可以修改此貨運成本計算模型的元素，以模擬貨運的實際情況。我們的許多客戶透過我們的關稅條款和規定以及透過協商的服務合約來使用我們的服務。我們也透過參與招標來爭取業務。客戶通常會在一到兩年的時間內對相對大量的貨運進行招標，並且通常會根據價格和服務選擇與有限數量的汽車承運商簽訂合約安排。"}],"competition":[{"en":"While the LTL industry is significantly consolidated, the overall transportation and logistics industry is intensely competitive and highly fragmented. We compete with regional, inter-regional and national LTL carriers and, to a lesser extent, with truckload carriers, small package carriers, airfreight carriers and railroads. We also compete with, and provide transportation services to, third-party logistics providers that determine both the mode of transportation and the carrier. Some of our competitors may have a broader global network and a wider range of services than we do. Competition in our industry is based primarily on service, price, available capacity and business relationships. We believe we are able to gain market share by providing high-quality service at a fair price and intend to expand the capacity of our network to accommodate future growth.","zh":"雖然零擔產業整合明顯，但整個運輸物流業競爭激烈且高度分散。我們與區域、區域間和國家零擔承運商競爭，並在較小程度上與整車承運商、小型包裹承運商、空運承運商和鐵路公司競爭。我們也與決定運輸方式和承運人的第三方物流提供者競爭並向其提供運輸服務。我們的一些競爭對手可能擁有比我們更廣泛的全球網路和更廣泛的服務。我們行業的競爭主要基於服務、價格、可用產能和業務關係。我們相信，我們能夠透過以公平的價格提供高品質的服務來獲得市場份額，並打算擴大我們的網路容量以適應未來的成長。"},{"en":"Throughout our organization, we continuously seek to improve customer service by, among other things, maximizing on-time performance and minimizing cargo claims. We believe our transit times are generally faster and more reliable than those of our principal national competitors, in part because of our efficient service center network, use of team drivers and proprietary technology. In addition, we provide greater geographic coverage than most of our regional competitors. Our diversified mix and scope of regional, inter-regional and national LTL service, combined with our value-added service offerings, enables us to provide our customers with a single source to meet their shipping and logistics needs. We believe the combination of these factors provides us with a distinct advantage over most of our competitors.","zh":"在我們的整個組織中，我們不斷尋求透過最大限度地提高準時率和最大限度地減少貨物索賠來改善客戶服務。我們相信，我們的運輸時間通常比我們主要的國內競爭對手更快、更可靠，部分原因是我們高效的服務中心網路、團隊司機的使用和專有技術。此外，我們提供比大多數區域競爭對手更大的地理覆蓋範圍。我們多元化的區域、區域間和國家零擔服務組合和範圍，加上我們提供的增值服務，使我們能夠為客戶提供單一來源，以滿足他們的運輸和物流需求。我們相信，這些因素的結合使我們比大多數競爭對手具有明顯的優勢。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"LTL Service Revenue","val":5446151000,"zh":"零擔服務收入"},{"name":"Other Service Revenue","val":50238000,"zh":"其他服務收入"}],"total":5496389000}},"peers":["JBHT","SAIA","IDXX","CPRT","VRSK"]}}